   Reasoning:
   - navy #0f1e36 / cream #fcf2e8 tokens: Linoxa V2 brand equity, navy for trust, cream for reading comfort (low eye strain)
   - radius 16px: consistent card language, matches Linoxa Home Two, reduces visual noise vs mixed radii
   - pill 28px arrow: Linoxa CTA signature, 28px circle tactile affordance, consistent with locations hub
   - giant bleed 18rem 0.06 opacity: Linoxa hero trademark, provides depth without competing with H1
   - 16/9 hero: Adore reference big image 6a98048f8709a.jpeg 16/9, Linoxa image treatment rounded 12px inner 16px outer
   - numbered H2 num circle navy 32px: Adore 9 sections pattern, but Linoxa navy circle 32px for hierarchy, scanability
   - bullet list ✓ circle #fcf2e8: Adore bullet list, but Linoxa cream circle with navy check for brand
   - reading-bar progress 3px navy fixed top: UX progress affordance, Adore scroll depth, Linoxa navy
   - TOC sticky top 96px: UX anchor, Linoxa sticky card pattern, helps long-form 9 sections navigation
   - breadcrumb Home→Insights→Title: Adore breadcrumb, SEO BreadcrumbList
   - date views reading time category pill: Adore meta 2026-09-02 views 143, Linoxa pill for category
   - author W avatar M-71: Linoxa proof, M-71 Zainab Tower, 10 years 200+ projects
   - Tags pills: Adore Tags, Linoxa pill style
   - CTA service + contact: Linoxa conversion pattern, service + contact
   - Related insights 3 cols: Linoxa grid 12-col gap 24px, 3 cols balanced
   - Final CTA dark + form for/id autocomplete GA4: Linoxa dark CTA, Netlify Forms, GA4 events, for/id accessibility
   - 100vh fallback 100svh: safe for mobile chrome, but blog uses auto height not hero
   - spacing clamp 64px 8vw 128px: Linoxa section rhythm, balanced whitespace
   - font Sora body + Syne headings per base.njk: distinctive not overused Plus Jakarta
#}
